  "idea": "Every best rectangle is as tall as some bar i and stretches left and right until it meets a shorter bar. So for each bar find the nearest shorter bar on each side; the area for bar i is h_i * (right - left - 1). A monotonic stack finds all of those boundaries in one pass.",
